stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle: Updates with opt-in controls
  Loading: Loading explanation for one activity
  Success: Direct credit or review candidates
  Empty: Unknown activity
  Refusal: Unavailable explanation with retry
  Retired: Private explanation cleared
  Loading --> Loading: Another click ignored
  Idle --> Loading: Show deal attribution
  Loading --> Success: Valid recorded attribution
  Loading --> Empty: Unknown activity
  Loading --> Refusal: Invalid result or read failure
  Refusal --> Loading: Explicit retry
  Success --> Idle: Close explanation and return focus
  Empty --> Idle: Close explanation and return focus
  Loading --> Idle: Close explanation
  Refusal --> Idle: Close explanation
  Success --> Loading: Select another activity
  Idle --> Retired: Session invalidated or detail disposed
  Loading --> Retired: Session invalidated, authorization denied or detail disposed
  Success --> Retired: Session invalidated or detail disposed
  Empty --> Retired: Session invalidated or detail disposed
  Refusal --> Retired: Session invalidated or detail disposed
  Retired --> Retired: Late import or read ignored
  Idle --> Idle: Late import or read ignored
  %% never Credit a candidate or render unparsed data
  %% never Start more than one attribution read per detail
